V4L2 UAPI headers

linux/videodev2.h, linux/v4l2-controls.h and linux/v4l2-common.h are verbatim
copies from Linux 6.12 (include/uapi/linux). Each carries
"(GPL-2.0+ WITH Linux-syscall-note) OR BSD-3-Clause" and is used here under
the BSD-3-Clause option.

linux/media.h, linux/v4l2-subdev.h, linux/v4l2-mediabus.h and
linux/media-bus-format.h are GPL-2.0 only and are deliberately NOT copied.
tests/abi reads them from a Linux tree as the reference. Replacing them with
BSD-licensed headers written from the documented interface is open question Q1
in docs/specs/SPEC_media_v4l2_native.md (bzdOS/bsdOS).
